This extension adds inZOI modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Aigenerated mods are installed to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with both a "Content" and a "Binaries" folder to the "BlueClient" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "LogicMods" folder to the "BlueClient\Content\Paks\LogicMods\LogicMods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".pak" file to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".pak" file to the "BlueClient\Content\Paks\~mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "dwmapi.dll" file to the "BlueClient\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "dsound.dll" and a file or folder named "sig.lua".[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".lua" file and a "Scripts" folder to the "BlueClient\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".dll" file and a "dlls" folder to the "BlueClient\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Creations mods are installed to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI" folder.[/*]
[*]Canvas mods are installed to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".glb" extension, a file with the ".dat" extension and a file with the ".json" extension to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI\AIGenerated\My3DPrinter" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "appearance.dat" to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI\Creations\MyAppearances" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "motion.dat" to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI\AIGenerated\MyAIMotions" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "albedo.jpg" to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI\Creations\MyTextures" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a top-level folder such as "BlueClient" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a config file such as "engine.ini" or "scalability.ini" to the "LOCALAPPDATA\BlueClient\Saved\Config\Windows" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".sav" file to the "DOCUMENTS\inZOI\SaveGames\USERID_FOLDER" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with anything unrecognised with no pak file to the "BlueClient\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

